  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Catastr. El Nino, PAHO</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Katastr. El Nino, PAHO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatserna f&#xf6;r att lindra n&#xf6;den efter &quot;El Niqo&quot; innefattar vattenrening, brunngr&#xe4;vning/borrning, malariabek&#xe4;mpning och  utbildning i hygien, PAHO genomf&#xf6;rarorganisation. F&#xf6;rl&#xe4;ngning av avtal pga f&#xf6;rsening malariabek&#xe4;mpning (PAHO:s ink&#xf6;p av produkter). I Cochabamba g&#xe5;r st&#xf6;det till uppf&#xf6;rande och utrustande av l&#xe4;ger f&#xf6;r jordb&#xe4;vningens offer, Sida &#xe4;r en av flera internationella givare.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to mitigate effects of &quot;El Niqo&quot; includes water sanitation, well-boring, combating of malaria and education in hygienics with PAHO as implementing organisation. Extension of agreement due to delay regarding combating of malaria (PAHO purchases of certain products). In Cochabamba support is used for the establishment and equipping of emergency camps, Sida one of several internat. donors.</narrative>
  </description>
